      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 8:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "All the commandments which I command thee this day shall ye observe to do, that ye may live, and multiply, and go in and possess the land which the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "DEU.8.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "DEU.8.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "sware unto your fathers.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And thou shalt remember all the way which the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.8.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "DEU.8.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "DEU.8.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "thy God led thee these forty years in the wilderness, to humble thee,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.8.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "DEU.8.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "DEU.8.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "to prove thee, to know what",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.8.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "was",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "DEU.8.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "DEU.8.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "in thine heart, whether thou wouldest keep his commandments, or no.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.8.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And he humbled thee, and suffered thee to hunger, and fed thee with manna, which thou knewest not, neither did thy fathers know; that he might make thee know that man doth not live by bread only, but by every",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.8.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "word",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "DEU.8.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "DEU.8.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "that proceedeth out of the mouth of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.8.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "DEU.8.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "DEU.8.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "doth man live.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.8.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Thy raiment waxed not old upon thee, neither did thy foot swell, these forty years.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.8.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 8:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Thou shalt also consider in thine heart, that, as a man chasteneth his son,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.8.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "so",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "DEU.8.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "DEU.8.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.8.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "DEU.8.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "DEU.8.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "thy God chasteneth thee.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.8.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Therefore thou shalt keep the commandments of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.8.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "DEU.8.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "DEU.8.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "thy God, to walk in his ways, and to fear him.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.8.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 8:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.8.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "DEU.8.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "DEU.8.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "thy God bringeth thee into a good land, a land of brooks of water, of fountains and depths that spring out of valleys and hills;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.8.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A land of wheat, and barley, and vines, and fig trees, and pomegranates; a land of oil olive, and honey;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.8.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.8.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 8:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A land wherein thou shalt eat bread without scarceness, thou shalt not lack any",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.8.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "thing",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "DEU.8.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "DEU.8.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "in it; a land whose stones",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.8.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "are",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "DEU.8.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "DEU.8.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "iron, and out of whose hills thou mayest dig brass.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.8.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When thou hast eaten and art full, then thou shalt bless the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.8.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "DEU.8.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "DEU.8.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "thy God for the good land which he hath given thee.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.8.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 8:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Beware that thou forget not the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.8.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "DEU.8.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "DEU.8.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "thy God, in not keeping his commandments, and his judgments, and his statutes, which I command thee this day:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.8.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 8:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lest",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.8.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "when",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "DEU.8.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "DEU.8.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "thou hast eaten and art full, and hast built goodly houses, and dwelt",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.8.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "therein;",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "DEU.8.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "DEU.8.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.8.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 8:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.8.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "when",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "DEU.8.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "DEU.8.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "thy herds and thy flocks multiply, and thy silver and thy gold is multiplied, and all that thou hast is multiplied;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.8.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 8:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then thine heart be lifted up, and thou forget the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.8.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.8.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "DEU.8.14",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "DEU.8.14"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "thy God, which brought thee forth out of the land of Egypt, from the house of bondage;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.8.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.8.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 8:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Who led thee through that great and terrible wilderness,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.8.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.8.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "wherein were",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "DEU.8.15",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "DEU.8.15"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "fiery serpents, and scorpions, and drought, where",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.8.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.8.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "there was",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "DEU.8.15",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "DEU.8.15"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "no water; who brought thee forth water out of the rock of flint;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.8.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.8.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 8:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Who fed thee in the wilderness with manna, which thy fathers knew not, that he might humble thee, and that he might prove thee, to do thee good at thy latter end;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.8.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.8.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 8:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And thou say in thine heart, My power and the might of",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.8.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.8.17"
            ]
